# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SelfishNet v2 - repository ignore rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Build output (any depth)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
publish/
TestResults/
artifacts/

# Debug symbols / logs produced by local builds
*.pdb
*.log
*.binlog
*.trx

# IDE / editor state
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Local portable builds at the project root. They are published artifacts, not
# source: build them with src\publish.bat; never commit them.
/SelfishNetV2-x64.exe
/SelfishNetV2-x86.exe

# NOTE: the following are deliberately TRACKED (project material, not build output):
#   - GUIDE_EN.txt / GUIDE_ES.txt (user documentation)
#   - docs/**, src/**            (specifications and application source)
